## Overview

A design system blended by Thema: https://light-saas.example/. Every value below was measured or derived deterministically and checked against WCAG 2.2 AA in light and dark.

Sources: https://light-saas.example/.

## Colors

| Role | Light | Dark | Use |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| canvas | #ffffff | #060606 | Page background |
| surface | #eef2f7 | #0c0d0f | Sections and muted panels |
| surface-raised | #ffffff | #060606 | Cards and popovers |
| ink | #0f172a | #d5e2fe | Main text |
| ink-muted | #5f6f86 | #6c7c93 | Secondary text, captions |
| hairline | #e2e8f0 | #10141a | Borders and dividers |
| primary | #2563eb | #2563eb | Main call to action, links |
| primary-ink | #ffffff | #eaf1ff | Text on primary |
| accent | #7c3aed | #7c3aed | Highlights, secondary emphasis |
| success | #028823 | #0a8b26 | Success messages |
| warning | #976501 | #a06d14 | Warnings |
| danger | #c33436 | #d44543 | Errors and destructive actions |
| info | #0273c5 | #147ace | Informational messages |

## Typography

Families: sans: Inter. Type scale ratio about 1.143.

| Step | Size | Line height | Weight | Tracking |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| sm | 14px | 1.43 | 400 | 0em |
| base | 16px | 1.5 | 400 | 0em |
| lg | 18px | 1.56 | 400 | 0em |
| xl | 20px | 1.4 | 600 | 0em |
| 2xl | 40px | 1.2 | 700 | -0.025em |
| 3xl | 60px | 1.2 | 700 | -0.025em |

## Layout

Content sits in a container up to 1280px wide with 24px side gutters. Sections are separated by 64px of vertical space.
Spacing uses a 4px base unit: 4px, 8px, 12px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 64px, 96px.

## Elevation & Depth

Shadows: sm 0px 1px 2px 0px oklch(0.208 0.04 265.8 / 0.06); md 0px 1px 2px 0px oklch(0.208 0.04 265.8 / 0.06); lg 0px 4px 12px 0px oklch(0.546 0.215 262.9 / 0.25).

## Shapes

Corner radius: sm 6px, md 8px, lg 12px; full 9999px for pills.

## Components

Buttons use primary #2563eb with primary-ink #ffffff text and the md radius. Cards use surface-raised with the lg radius. Inputs sit on canvas with the sm radius. Every component has a dark variant with the -dark suffix.

## Do's and Don'ts

- Do use primary for the main call to action on a screen, and accent sparingly.
- Do put text only on the backgrounds it is paired with here: those pairs pass WCAG AA.
- Do take every size and gap from the spacing scale.
- Don't invent colors, sizes or radii that aren't listed in this file.
- Don't use ink-muted for long body text or on the primary color.

## Motion

Fast transitions take 150ms, standard ones 250ms, with easing cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1).

## Agent rules

- Read the tokens in the front matter as the source of truth; the prose only explains them.
- Default text is ink on canvas; the base text style is 16px in Inter.
- Use the dark tokens and -dark components when the page is in dark mode.
